r developer  developers list and maybe be able to use  it in their own research we would love  to see more people using it in different  ways that we never thought possible  and so um  technical questions can be sent to the  developer  and you can check out the program you  can download it now and start using it  or you can join the developers list  which is linked on the homepage of the  google code  and i will stop there and take any  questions that you may have
 

